#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Spring-quarter shipped-orders reconciliation (working script, not a deliverable).

  recon.py pages     DATA_DIR            fetch every orders page (raw bodies) into DATA_DIR/pages
  recon.py customers DATA_DIR            fetch each needed customer once into DATA_DIR/customers
  recon.py compute   DATA_DIR OUT_JSON   compute the figures from the saved raw data

Run with `python3 -I`; DATA_DIR is only ever passed as an argument.
